    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBeautifully presented and very spacious one-bedroom apartment situated a short walk from Eyre Square in the exclusive development of Tobar na mBan on Lough Atalia Road. With stunning water views on your doorstep, the property is located in an excellent area close to the city centre yet in a quiet, very secure development with private parking and a useful, private storage area.\n\nConstructed circa 2009, the property is impressively finished throughout with a high energy rating and offers considerably more than the average one bedroom apartment due its size, a private terrace, basement allocated parking behind security gates and a large storage facility suitable for many options. The apartment is located on the ground floor with the entrance hall leading to the open plan living space. The kitchen is fully fitted with contemporary units, integrated appliances and breakfast bar. French doors lead out to the private terrace which has a nice southeast aspect. The bedroom is very spacious and includes a fitted wardrobe. The large utility/laundry room with excellent built in storage is a much-needed additional space not normally experienced in one-bedroom apartments. The final room in this beautiful apartment is the spacious fully tiled bathroom that comes with a separate shower unit in addition to the deep bath. \n\nTobar na mBan is a highly regarded, modern development in an excellent location with the heart of Galway city just a short walk away. Number 14 is a very spacious, high quality property offering convenient and low maintenance living in a secure complex."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nLarge, spacious entry with tiled floor.\n\nKitchen: - \nTiled floor, front aspect window, built in kitchen with breakfast bar, integrated oven, hob, fridge freezer & dishwasher.\n\nLiving Area: - \nBright open plan space overlooking courtyard with access to own private terrace, carpet flooring, tv point.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet, fitted wardrobe, tv point, side aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nLarge and beautifully finished, fully tiled, WC, shower, bath & vanity unit.\n\nUtility Room: - \nSpacious room with excellent built in storage, tiled floor & plumbed for washing machine.\n\nStorage unit: - \nSecure internal storage unit for own private storage. Perfectly suitable for bicycle, sports or other equipment.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent location walking distance to Eyre Square</li><li>Private parking</li><li>Large, spacious ground floor apartment</li><li>Energy efficient rating</li><li>Private terrace area</li><li>Secure development</li><li>Storage unit</li><li>Beautifully presented</ul>"
      },
